<?php
/**
 * Secomm Launchpad — Quick View modal (TASK-Z3DAH5, SLP-157; restyle TASK-WN9VB0)
 *
 * Single reusable modal for the product list. Renders a native <dialog> per the
 * Hyvä UI modal.A-simple pattern; product data is lazy-loaded via GraphQL when a
 * card dispatches the `open-quickview` window event. Add to cart posts to the core
 * `checkout/cart/add` controller with the AJAX header so the session quote stays
 * authoritative (see record §Approach for the GraphQL rejection rationale).
 *
 * TASK-WN9VB0 (SLP-157 design fix): restyled to Figma 2636-55026 (desktop) /
 * 2330-39558 (mobile). Brand + rating row reuses the global .hp-card-brandrow*
 * component classes from theme/card.css for 1:1 card parity; swatch states are
 * scoped to .quickview-modal in web/tailwind/theme/quickview.css. The whole
 * info column is wrapped in the add-to-cart <form> so FormData still carries
 * the selected super_attribute options — and the form deliberately carries no
 * class/id matching the Monsoon intercept selectors. Stock/SKU/Information/
 * Materials are desktop-only (hidden below md, per ticket decision).
 *
 * @var Template $block
 * @var Escaper $escaper
 * @var ViewModelRegistry $viewModels
 */

